WEBVTT

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:40.030
I guess this is the inn.

00:01:41.140 --> 00:01:45.020
<b>Episode 6
Ten'i
Is Tested
by Sousou</b>

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:51.250
So you put your fingers through, like this...

00:01:52.780 --> 00:01:54.000
See! A bridge!

00:01:56.270 --> 00:01:58.010
See! Teigun Mountain!

00:01:58.010 --> 00:01:59.970
Wow!

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:03.160
You're good at string figures!

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:09.880
I've been weaving mats and sandals since
I was a kid, so I'm good at this stuff.

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:12.190
So next...

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:13.680
Welcome back!

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:14.860
Kan'u-san!

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:16.750
You're late.

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:20.770
Did you take a bath?

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:23.200
Yeah, at Sousou's place.

00:02:23.430 --> 00:02:25.070
I see.

00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:28.750
You were washing off the sweat
you worked up in the bedroom.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.310
N-No!

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:34.670
A lot of stuff happened.

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:39.000
How did it go for Kakuka-san
and Teiiku-san?

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:43.750
It went well. They were both
hired by Sousou-dono.

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:45.350
Great!

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:49.130
Anyway, let's go eat!

00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:53.650
I'm so hungry, my back and my
butt are gonna stick together!

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:58.850
Rin Rin-chan, if your back and butt
stuck together, you'd split in half...

00:02:58.850 --> 00:03:02.660
And that's why we need to go and eat!

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:06.990
The place we went for lunch
was good. Want to go there?

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:10.560
Yeah. The bamboo shoots there were good.

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:14.220
I liked the stir-fried lamb!

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:16.630
The mabodofu was yummy, too.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:19.260
What's wrong? You look unhappy.

00:03:20.150 --> 00:03:22.680
Do you want to go someplace else?

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:27.640
No. I was just thinking about Kada-dono.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:30.100
What happened to him?

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:36.450
I didn't hear the details, but he
angered Sousou-dono somehow.

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:38.220
That's a problem...

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:39.280
Yeah.

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:42.980
I hope his head is still attached
to his shoulders...

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:46.880
Damn, he's fast!

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:49.420
All right, we're pulling out for now!

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:50.100
Right.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.540
Looks like I lost them.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.020
Damn it.

00:03:55.370 --> 00:03:58.010
Why is this happening to me?

00:03:58.010 --> 00:04:03.780
I need to find the <i>Crucial Keys</i>
and seal it as fast as I can.

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:09.600
A book containing vast magical energy...
The <i>Crucial Keys</i>.

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:12.560
I hope it isn't being used for evil.

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:17.880
Crucial Keys to
the Way of Peace

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:24.020
...The butterfly floats through my dreams.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:31.750
Thanks, everyone!

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:35.710
I love you all!

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:42.010
I guess you're all still fired up, so let's-

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:42.010
Don't step on my foot!

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:43.260
I did not!

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:44.390
You just did!

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:46.300
What, you got some proof?

00:04:58.490 --> 00:05:02.910
OK, you two! No fighting!

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:05.850
Let's be friends!

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:08.290
No fighting...

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:10.030
Let's be friends...

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:14.880
Let's be friends.

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:22.210
We had another great performance today.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:25.670
Hey, what was it that you did today?

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:27.610
Well, you know...

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:30.640
Hey, come on. Tell us!

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:34.600
Chihou-neesan, you used some
kind of new magic, didn't you?

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:39.230
Yesterday, I put another spell on this.

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:46.110
If I activate the spell and make a request
with this, people will listen!

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:50.620
So if you use that, you can
ask anyone to do anything?

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:53.480
Sadly, it's not that easy...

00:05:53.480 --> 00:05:58.320
It only works on people who are
already entranced by us...

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:04.150
Essentially, people who have
heard our songs and like us.

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:05.170
I see.

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:13.060
So basically, it makes someone already inclined
to listen to one of us even more likely to do so.

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:14.520
Yeah, something like that.

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:16.140
Aw...

00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:21.190
But this thing uses a ton of magical energy!

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:26.290
It's beyond what I could use with
my power alone, but...

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:29.700
The <i>Crucial Keys</i> is really great!

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:39.970
Man, the lamb stir-fry here is great!

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:44.590
The mabodofu is really something, too.

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:48.830
You don't understand the subtle
flavor of these bamboo shoots.

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:52.750
You two are still such kids.

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:55.810
Chou'un-san, you really do
love your bamboo shoots.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:58.310
Fried rice is up!

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:00.920
I see. So that's why!

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:03.060
What? That doesn't make any sense!

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:05.360
Thanks!

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:11.120
The food here looks common, but every
dish has something special about it.

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:16.200
It's practically wasted on Rin Rin,
who eats anything if she's hungry.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:18.370
It was really good!

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.060
Um, Rin Rin-chan...

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:23.670
Oh, you really cleaned your plates!

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:29.210
I'm Ten'i, the chef here at this restaurant.

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:32.970
Then you made this food!

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:33.770
Yes!

00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:38.090
Um, if you don't mind, would you try this?

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:40.890
Meat buns!

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:42.100
Those look good.

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:45.600
I was thinking of adding them to the menu.

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:48.230
Would you try them and
tell me what you think?

00:07:48.740 --> 00:07:51.030
I'd be delighted to.

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:57.860
It's got lots of the juice left, but
it doesn't feel too heavy.

00:07:57.860 --> 00:08:00.140
It's really good!

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:02.460
That's bad manners, Rin Rin-chan.

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:04.980
Don't talk with your mouth full.

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:08.880
This isn't pork... It's not beef, either.

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:10.350
Ten'i, was it?

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:12.170
What is this meat?

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:16.100
Guess!

00:08:17.130 --> 00:08:19.930
It's not deer or boar...

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:21.740
Can't you tell?

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:24.940
It's a warm-blooded animal that
walks around on two legs.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:28.080
Warm-blooded and two-legged...

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:32.240
The first thing that comes to mind that's
two-legged and warm-blooded is...

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:33.740
<b><i>Human</i></b>

00:08:33.730 --> 00:08:36.960
I-Is it-

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:40.070
Yup! It's chicken!

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:46.670
D-Don't scare me like that!

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:51.190
That nearly scared the very
meat off my bones.

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:55.470
Try not to be clever when
you're sweating with fear.

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:57.730
Those meat buns were good!

00:08:57.730 --> 00:08:59.430
Thank you!

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:02.020
Oh, hello, Kakouen-dono!

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:05.890
Sousou-dono wants to thank us?

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:15.240
Yes. Once a month, Karin-sama holds a gourmet
food tasting, and she herself cooks.

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:24.870
She said she'd like to invite you as thanks
for saving her from those assassins.

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:28.290
What do you do at a gourmet
food tasting?

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:31.770
A gourmand is someone who
likes delicious food.

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:35.640
So I'm sure there'll be something for us to eat...

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:36.750
Food?                                             Food?

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:38.050
All right!                                     All right!

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:39.170
Hey, Rin Rin!

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:40.010
That's bad manners!

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:45.770
And um, Ryuubi-dono, um... Uh,
please try to keep it down...

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:49.440
Then you'll accept my lord's invitation, yes?

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:50.830
Of course!

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:55.610
I'll make sure I'm extra hungry by only going
back for more three times at breakfast!

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:29.560
Kan'u, thank you for coming.

00:10:30.050 --> 00:10:34.020
And everyone, enjoy the food I made.

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:42.890
Now then, let the gourmet
food tasting begin!

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:55.880
I didn't know that Sousou-dono cooked.

00:10:55.880 --> 00:11:00.070
Cooking mastery has always been said to
lead to mastery of the strategic arts.

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:02.180
Actually, I've never heard
anyone say that...

00:11:03.070 --> 00:11:07.980
The look on Karin-sama's face when
she bit into that plum...

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:11.600
Just remembering it makes me drool...

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:20.760
Even without that, I've seen you spend
whole days drooling over Karin-sama.

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:26.970
Shunran, you drool down there
all day anyway, don't you?

00:11:26.970 --> 00:11:29.100
Why do you say that?

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:32.210
Have you ever seen it or something?

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:37.240
Sister, I'm not sure that's the best choice
of topics when we're about to eat...

00:11:37.240 --> 00:11:40.930
I'm not talking about it because I want to!

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:41.800
Keifa said-

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:42.970
Right, right.

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:44.720
I get it.

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:48.030
If you're loud, you'll interfere
with Karin-sama's cooking.

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:53.440
Great technique, isn't it?

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:56.160
Yeah. If she wanted, she
could be a real chef.

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:58.300
I wonder what she's making.

00:11:58.300 --> 00:11:59.820
I can't wait to see!

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:05.950
We've prepared drinks and appetizers.
Please enjoy them before the meal.

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:11.210
It's an alcoholic drink made from
Sousou-sama's favorite fruit, oranges.

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:13.830
This is good!

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:16.920
I've never had it before, but it's not bad.

00:12:18.390 --> 00:12:22.410
Why do we get goat milk instead of that?

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:23.930
It's an adult thing.

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:28.140
What a full-bodied scent...

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:40.610
I can almost see Karin-sama tramping
the oranges with her beautiful feet...

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:43.490
And this flavor!

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:49.490
I bet the sweat dripped down her body into the oranges,
giving them their special, unique taste!

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:55.860
I want to lick the orange
juice off her feet...

00:12:55.860 --> 00:12:59.130
I want to stick my tongue between
her toes and clean them.

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:01.570
No, I know...

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:13.810
I want to be the fruit, filled with juice,
and have her step on me...

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:15.570
More!

00:13:15.570 --> 00:13:17.500
More...

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:25.360
I'd heard that Sousou's army was rather yuri
in nature, but I didn't expect this...

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:28.570
Shouldn't someone stop her?

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:31.370
Here's a hot springs egg for you.

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:33.580
Is this a quail egg?

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:40.520
Maybe it's a sea turtle's egg!

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:44.970
This strong taste that no
bird's egg could evoke...

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:48.640
At first, it seems simple, but the
taste is actually very complex.

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:51.100
This isn't enough to fill me up.

00:13:51.860 --> 00:13:52.980
It's done!

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:57.390
Our first dish: sea bass sashimi, from
Shoukou in the Kouto region.

00:13:57.910 --> 00:14:02.780
I wish we had some ginger from Shoku
to go with it, but I couldn't get any.

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:12.900
The thick fat spreads out in your mouth,
like it's melting on your tongue...

00:14:12.900 --> 00:14:18.040
It really brings out the delicious
flavor of the ingredients!

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:21.140
You can see through it.

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:25.760
How stingy is she, cutting it this thin?

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:30.260
Bear paw preserved in honey
and boiled in soy.

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:34.770
Bird's nest soup with pickled sturgeon eggs.

00:14:36.110 --> 00:14:41.610
Lightly broiled goose liver with shouro
mushrooms imported from the west.

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:46.460
It's all so tiny, I'm never gonna get full!

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:52.030
The food I ate at Ten'i's place in
town was much, much better!

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:54.370
I can't ignore that.

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:57.830
No, she's just a kid. Don't worry about it.

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:02.230
If there's such a good cook
in the lands I rule,

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:05.580
then I want to sample her cooking.

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:07.880
Bring her here, Shunran!

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:10.260
Right.

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:17.470
Um, what is this?

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:22.650
Ten'i, I'm told you're a very talented chef.

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:25.320
I want to taste your cooking.

00:15:25.740 --> 00:15:30.490
You can use any of those ingredients,
so prepare a dish for us.

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:33.280
A dish...

00:15:34.310 --> 00:15:38.580
Make something great and show
curly-hair who's boss!

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:40.490
But...

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:49.130
All right!

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:51.010
I'll do my best!

00:16:01.590 --> 00:16:02.650
It's done!

00:16:03.030 --> 00:16:05.110
Enjoy.

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:08.820
I'm digging in!

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:14.510
It's great!

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:16.660
The meat inside is lamb, right?

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:19.660
The mabo's spiciness really
stimulates the appetite.

00:16:20.530 --> 00:16:22.370
This crunch is bamboo shoots?

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:24.960
Every part of it is downright delicious.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:26.780
Meat buns, huh?

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:30.680
The taste of the skin is fine.

00:16:30.680 --> 00:16:34.680
And the crunch of the chopped-up bamboo
shoots in the filling is also good.

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:37.470
But there's a bit too much flavoring.

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:43.310
The seasoning on the lamb and the mabo
are canceling each other out.

00:16:44.880 --> 00:16:46.520
Is this...

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:48.440
Is there something wrong
with the meat bun?

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:52.020
Look. Lamb, mabo, and bamboo shoots...

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:57.500
These are all the things we ate
at Ten'i-san's place and liked!

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:59.000
That's right!

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:05.020
You came to my place for lunch and
dinner yesterday, didn't you?

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:08.440
You ordered those three dishes both times,

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:11.130
so I was sure you liked them.

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:16.150
And since this was so sudden,
I didn't know what to make...

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:20.220
So I decided to combine them all!

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:22.640
I see. So that's why you made this.

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:30.690
But it's something I've never made before,
so the flavor isn't quite what it should be...

00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:37.220
It was pretty good for something
made by a city chef.

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:39.280
Not as good as Karin-sama's, though.

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:40.380
No, Keifa.

00:17:40.380 --> 00:17:41.910
I lose.

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:46.490
I invited Kan'u here as thanks,

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:53.080
but I decided to show off my own abilities,
rather than ask her preferences.

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:57.220
It can rightfully be said that I have not
treated her properly as my guest.

00:17:57.220 --> 00:18:01.130
Yet Ten'i, despite being
brought here abruptly,

00:18:01.130 --> 00:18:04.430
considered her guests' preferences
above all else.

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:07.750
This is clearly my loss.

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:12.270
Um... I'm not sure about that.

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:14.320
What do you mean?

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:20.820
You tried your best to cook for Kan'u-san.

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:25.300
I think that, in itself, is commendable.

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:29.740
And maybe Chouhi-chan didn't really like it,

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:33.050
but I thought the food you
cooked was delicious.

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:37.810
And there aren't winners or
losers in cooking anyway.

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:42.010
Everyone is supposed to have
fun eating together!

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:47.390
Everyone is supposed to have
fun eating together...

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:49.480
There aren't winners or losers...

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:53.110
Jeez, you're such a baby.

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:56.280
Oh, no!

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:57.780
The cow we'd saved to cook-

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:01.820
Kakuka, use your nosebleed to blind it.

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:05.950
U-Um, I think showing it red would
only make things worse...

00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:36.290
That surprised me...

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:39.610
That surprised all of us!

00:19:42.930 --> 00:19:45.490
You want me to join your bodyguards?

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:50.530
Yes. Not using your incredible
power would be a waste.

00:19:50.530 --> 00:19:54.170
Would you wield it by my side?

00:19:54.410 --> 00:19:57.860
You're far too kind.

00:19:57.860 --> 00:20:02.990
But I already have a job. I can't just quit...

00:20:02.990 --> 00:20:05.800
I wouldn't make you do it right away.

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:08.680
Talk with the owner of the restaurant
and then decide.

00:20:09.510 --> 00:20:10.640
Very well.

00:20:10.990 --> 00:20:16.580
For a while now, I've been wanting
someone to discuss cooking with.

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:20.840
Unfortunately, no one in my current
army really understands food.

00:20:22.460 --> 00:20:24.070
I...

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:31.690
Rin-chan, looks like you're getting someone
new to work with already. Great, huh?

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:35.000
But I... I...

00:20:35.850 --> 00:20:39.960
I look forward to having you join me.

00:20:41.390 --> 00:20:42.930
OK!

